---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How we collect, use and protect your data when you use our website, submit an inquiry or subscribe to our newsletter."
  path="/privacy-policy/"
>
  <Section title="Privacy Policy">
    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700 [&_h2]:mt-8 [&_h2]:text-lg [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h2]:text-slate-900">
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Last updated: September 2026</p>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-4 text-xs text-amber-800">
        <strong>Note:</strong> This is a technical placeholder. Have the final text
        reviewed by a legal professional before launch, especially for EU visitors
        (GDPR) and other regulated markets.
      </div>

      <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        TODO: legal entity name, registered address and contact email as configured
        in <code>src/config.ts</code>.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Data we collect</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
        <li><strong>Inquiry data</strong>: name, company, country, email, phone/WhatsApp, product interest, quantity and message — provided by you when submitting the inquiry form.</li>
        <li><strong>Newsletter data</strong>: email address — provided only with your explicit marketing consent.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics data</strong>: anonymized usage statistics (Google Analytics 4), loaded only after you consent via the cookie banner.</li>
        <li><strong>Attribution data</strong>: UTM parameters and referring page, used solely to understand which channel your inquiry came from.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. How we use your data</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
        <li>Inquiry data is used to respond to your request and prepare quotations.</li>
        <li>Newsletter data is used to send marketing emails you explicitly opted in to. You can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
        <li>Submitting an inquiry does <strong>not</strong> subscribe you to marketing emails.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Cookies and consent</h2>
      <p>
        Marketing and analytics cookies are only set after you click "Accept all"
        in the consent banner. "Necessary only" keeps them disabled. You can change
        your choice at any time by clearing site data in your browser.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Third-party processors</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
        <li>Google Analytics (statistics, consent-based)</li>
        <li>Cloudflare (hosting, CDN, bot protection)</li>
        <li>Resend (transactional email delivery)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You may request access, correction or deletion of your personal data at any
        time by emailing us. TODO: add DPO / contact details and any
        market-specific rights text (GDPR Art. 15–21, etc.).
      </p>

      <h2>7. Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        Inquiry data is retained as long as needed to handle your request and for
        legitimate business record-keeping. TODO: confirm retention periods.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
